urs-PAR(kunst)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/whalll.be\/evenements\/categorie\/biennale-waw\/","email":"ijozefek@woluwe1150.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 435 59 92","phone_booking":"+32 2 435 59 99","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007281"},"pt":{"name":"WAW ! P(art)cours-PAR(kunst)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/whalll.be\/evenements\/categorie\/biennale-waw\/","email":"ijozefek@woluwe1150.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 435 59 92","phone_booking":"+32 2 435 59 99","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007281"},"en":{"name":"WAW ! P(art)cours-PAR(kunst)","shortdescr":"The parks, squares and historic monuments (castle and priory) of the communes of Woluwe-Saint-Pierre, Auderghem and Woluwe-Saint-Lambert will become the settings for singular artistic proposals. One of the leitmotifs of WAW! (5th edition of P(ART)cours \/ Par(KUNST) is re-enchanting the city (again).\n","longdescr":"Launched in 2014 with its first edition organised in the commune of Woluwe-Saint-Pierre, the P(ART)cours \/ Par(KUNST) Biennial invites artists to take over the public space. Parks, remarkable squares, castles and other heritage treasures become the setting for singular artistic projects. Through this interaction, a new enchantment emanates from these sites and the works of art - installations, monumental sculptures, sound installations... - take on a special meaning. \nIn 2024, the fifth edition of the Biennial, renamed WAW!, will once again bring together three municipalities: Woluwe-Saint-Pierre, Auderghem and Woluwe-Saint-Lambert. From the Rouge-Clo\u00eetre to the Place du Temps Libre, from the Malou Park to the Mellaerts ponds, fourteen artists (two of them working in duo) are challenging the public along a particular curatorial line: drawing attention to the aberrations and excesses of our society; making a restorative gesture; taking care of the environment, the land we live on, the collective memory, our fellow human beings...","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/whalll.be\/evenements\/categorie\/biennale-waw\/","email":"ijozefek@woluwe1150.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 435 59 92","phone_booking":"+32 2 435 59 99","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007281"},"it":{"name":"WAW ! P(art)cours-PAR(kunst)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/whalll.be\/evenements\/categorie\/biennale-waw\/","email":"ijozefek@woluwe1150.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 435 59 92","phone_booking":"+32 2 435 59 99","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007281"},"cn":{"name":"WAW ! P(art)cours-PAR(kunst)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/whalll.be\/evenements\/categorie\/biennale-waw\/","email":"ijozefek@woluwe1150.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 435 59 92","phone_booking":"+32 2 435 59 99","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007281"},"fr":{"name":"WAW ! P(art)cours-Par(kunst)","shortdescr":"Les parcs, les places, les monuments historiques (ch\u00e2teau et prieur\u00e9) des communes de Woluwe-Saint-Pierre, Auderghem et Woluwe-Saint-Lambert, deviennent des \u00e9crins pour des propositions plastiques singuli\u00e8res. R\u00e9enchanter la ville (\u00e0 nouveau) tel est l\u2019un des leimotiv de WAW! (5\u00e8me \u00e9dition de P(ART)cours \/ Par(KUNST).\n\n","longdescr":"Lanc\u00e9e en 2014 pour une premi\u00e8re \u00e9dition organis\u00e9e sur la commune de Woluwe-Saint-Pierre, la Biennale P(ART)cours \/ Par(KUNST) invite des artistes \u00e0 investir l\u2019espace public. Parcs, places remarquables, ch\u00e2teaux et autres perles du patrimoine deviennent les \u00e9crins de propositions plastiques singuli\u00e8res. Dans cette interaction, les lieux sont r\u00e9enchant\u00e9s et les \u0153uvres d\u2019art - installations, sculptures monumentales, mises en espace sonores\u2026 - prennent un sens particulier. \nEn 2024, la cinqui\u00e8me \u00e9dition de la Biennale, rebaptis\u00e9e WAW !, r\u00e9unit \u00e0 nouveau trois communes : Woluwe-Saint-Pierre, Auderghem et Woluwe-Saint-Lambert. Du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre \u00e0 la place du Temps Libre, du parc Malou aux \u00e9tangs Mellaerts, quatorze artistes (dont deux travaillant en duo) interpellent le public selon une ligne curatoriale particuli\u00e8re : attirer l\u2019attention sur les d\u00e9rives et les exc\u00e8s de notre soci\u00e9t\u00e9, poser un geste r\u00e9parateur, prendre soin de l\u2019environnement, du territoire que l\u2019on habite, de la m\u00e9moire collective, de nos semblables\u2026 \n","performers":"Elodie Antoine - Manu Bayon - Pricillia Beccari - L\u00e9a Belooussovitch - Olivier Bovy - Claude Cattelain  - Alexis Deconinck - Ma\u00eblle Dufour - Beno\u00eet Jacquemin - Caroline Le M\u00e9haut\u00e9  - Louise Limontas - L\u00e9opoldine Roux - Niko Van Stichel & Lut Vandebos.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/whalll.be\/evenements\/categorie\/biennale-waw\/","email":"ijozefek@woluwe1150.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 435 59 92","phone_booking":"+32 2 435 59 99","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007281"},"sp":{"name":"WAW ! P(art)cours-PAR(kunst)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/whalll.be\/evenements\/categorie\/biennale-waw\/","email":"ijozefek@woluwe1150.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 435 59 92","phone_booking":"+32 2 435 59 99","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007281"},"nl":{"name":"WAW ! P(art)cours-PAR(kunst)","shortdescr":"De parken, pleinen en historische monumenten (kasteel en priorij) van de gemeenten Sint-Pieters-Woluwe, Oudergem en Sint-Lambrechts-Woluwe worden omgetoverd tot decors voor bijzondere artistieke voorstellen. De stad (opnieuw) betoveren is een van de leidmotieven van WAW! (5e editie van P(ART)cours \/ Par(KUNST).\n","longdescr":"De Bi\u00ebnnale P(ART)cours \/ Par(KUNST), waarvan de eerste editie in 2014 plaatsvond in de gemeente Sint-Pieters-Woluwe, nodigt kunstenaars uit om de openbare ruimte in te nemen. Parken, opmerkelijke pleinen, kastelen en andere erfgoedparels worden het decor voor bijzondere beeldende projecten. Door deze interactie gaat er een betovering uit van deze plaatsen en krijgen de kunstwerken - installaties, monumentale sculpturen, klankinstallaties... - een bijzondere betekenis. \nIn 2024 zal de vijfde editie van de Bi\u00ebnnale, omgedoopt tot WAW!, opnieuw drie gemeenten samenbrengen: Sint-Pieters-Woluwe, Oudergem en Sint-Lambrechts-Woluwe. Van het Rood Klooster tot het Vrijetijdsplein, van het Malou Park tot de Mellaertsvijvers, gaan veertien kunstenaars (waarvan er twee in duo werken) de confrontatie met het publiek aan volgens een specifieke curatori\u00eble lijn: de aandacht vestigen op de excessen en uitwassen van onze samenleving ; een herstellend gebaar maken ; zorg dragen voor het milieu, het land waarop we wonen, het collectieve geheugen, onze medemensen...","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/whalll.be\/evenements\/categorie\/biennale-waw\/","email":"ijozefek@woluwe1150.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 435 59 92","phone_booking":"+32 2 435 59 99","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007281"}},"place":{"id":274960,"translations":{"de":{"name":"P(ART)cours : Parc de Woluwe, Parc Malou et Parc Seny","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1150","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","address_line1":"P(ART)cours : Parc de Woluwe, Parc Malou et Parc Seny","address_line2":"1150 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","descr