ail":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 94 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554601"},"en":{"name":"Don't call it Art brut","shortdescr":"Like a K-Way from the 1980s, the ART ET MARGES MUSEUM turns itself inside out to unfold an expanse of colours and shapes that you never knew existed! ","longdescr":"Like a K-Way from the 1980s, the ART ET MARGES MUSEUM turns itself inside out to unfold an expanse of colours and shapes that you never knew existed! At the bottom, a warning from Jean Dubuffet, the inventor of Art brut: \u201cYou will have to find another designation\u201d. The letter dates from 1984. With this terminological marker in place, Art en marge began its search for art that grows on the edges. Since then, the association has become the ART ET MARGES MUSEUM. How did its collection develop, how have its ambitions evolved, and what about the whole field around it, filled with all the names born of the Dubuffetian ban? Some answers can be found in this exhibition, which will evolve throughout the year.\r\n\r\nThe ART ET MARGES MUSEUM takes you into its reserves, brings out works that taste had relegated there, serves you its new discoveries on a rotating tray and questions the margin with artists from the contemporary scene who resolutely ask us the question of the limits of Art brut. Oops! Don't call it Art brut, he said!\r\n\r\nHIGHLIGHTS\r\nApr. 4, 2023\u2014July 2, 2023 Francis Goidts | Executive Master Food Design ARBA ESA\r\nJuly 6, 2023\u2014Nov. 5, 2023 Adalberto Colarelli | Shen \u00d6zdemir\r\nNov. 9, 2023\u2014Jan. 28, 2024 Margot | Pratique de l\u2019exposition ESA Saint-Luc Bruxelles\r\nFebr. 8, 2024\u2014Apr. 21, 2024 Norbert Moutier | \u00c9ric Croes\r\n(Attention: the museum is closed for installation between these periods)","performers":"Francis Goidts, Executive Master Food Design ARBA ESA, Adalberto Colarelli, Shen \u00d6zdemir, Margot, Pratique de l'exposition ESA Saint-Luc Bruxelles, Norbert Moutier, \u00c9ric Croes ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","email":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 94 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554601"},"it":{"name":"N'appelez pas \u00e7a Art brut","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","email":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 94 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554601"},"cn":{"name":"N'appelez pas \u00e7a Art brut","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","email":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 94 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554601"},"fr":{"name":"N'appelez pas \u00e7a Art brut","shortdescr":"Tel un K-Way des ann\u00e9es 80, le ART ET MARGES MUS\u00c9E se retourne sur lui-m\u00eame pour d\u00e9ployer une \u00e9tendue de couleurs et de formes que vous ne soup\u00e7onniez pas !","longdescr":"Tel un K-Way des ann\u00e9es 80, le ART ET MARGES MUS\u00c9E se retourne sur lui-m\u00eame pour d\u00e9ployer une \u00e9tendue de couleurs et de formes que vous ne soup\u00e7onniez pas ! Au fond d\u2019une poche, une mise en garde de Jean Dubuffet, l\u2019inventeur de l\u2019Art brut : \u00ab il vous faudra trouver une autre d\u00e9signation \u00bb. La lettre date de 1984. Cette balise terminologique pos\u00e9e, Art en marge commen\u00e7ait ses prospections pour trouver un art qui pousse dans les lisi\u00e8res. Depuis, l\u2019association est devenue le ART ET MARGES MUS\u00c9E. Comment a grandi sa collection, comment ont \u00e9volu\u00e9 ses ambitions, et le champ tout autour, garni de toutes les appellations n\u00e9es de l\u2019interdiction dubuffetienne ? Des pistes de r\u00e9ponse sont \u00e0 trouver dans cette expo chantier qui \u00e9voluera tout au long de l'ann\u00e9e.\r\n\r\nLe ART ET MARGES MUS\u00c9E vous fait rentrer dans ses r\u00e9serves, en ressort les \u0153uvres que le go\u00fbt y avait rel\u00e9gu\u00e9, vous sert ses nouvelles d\u00e9couvertes sur un plateau tournant et interroge la marge avec des artistes de la sc\u00e8ne contemporaine qui nous posent r\u00e9solument la question des limites de l\u2019Art brut. Oups ! N\u2019appelez pas \u00e7a Art brut, il disait !\r\n\r\nFOCUS\r\n06.04.2023\u201402.07.2023 Francis Goidts | Executive Master Food Design ARBA ESA\r\n06.07.2023\u201405.11.2023 Adalberto Colarelli | Shen \u00d6zdemir\r\n09.11.2023\u201428.01.2024 Margot | Pratique de l\u2019exposition ESA Saint-Luc Bruxelles\r\n08.02.2024\u201421.04.2024 Norbert Moutier | \u00c9ric Croes\r\n(Attention : le mus\u00e9e est ferm\u00e9 pour montage entre ces p\u00e9riodes)\r\n\r\n","performers":"Francis Goidts, Executive Master Food Design ARBA ESA, Adalberto Colarelli, Shen \u00d6zdemir, Margot, Pratique de l'exposition ESA Saint-Luc Bruxelles, Norbert Moutier, \u00c9ric Croes ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","email":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 94 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554601"},"sp":{"name":"N'appelez pas \u00e7a Art brut","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","email":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 94 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554601"},"nl":{"name":"Noem het geen Art brut","shortdescr":"Als een K-Way uit de jaren 1980 keert het ART ET MARGES MUSEUM zichzelf binnenstebuiten en ontvouwt een waaier van kleuren en vormen waarvan niemand het bestaan vermoedde!","longdescr":"Als een K-Way uit de jaren 1980 keert het ART ET MARGES MUSEUM zichzelf binnenstebuiten en ontvouwt een waaier van kleuren en vormen waarvan niemand het bestaan vermoedde! Helemaal onderaan staat een waarschuwing van Jean Dubuffet, de uitvinder van de art brut: \u201cZoek een andere benaming\u201d. De brief dateert uit 1984. Met deze terminologische kwestie begon Art en marge zijn zoektocht naar kunst die floreert aan de zijkant. Sindsdien is de vereniging uitgegroeid tot het ART ET MARGES MUSEUM. Hoe groeide de collectie, hoe evolueerden de ambities en de context, gevuld met alle namen die ontstonden uit de ban van Dubuffet? Enkele antwoorden zijn te vinden in deze tentoonstelling, die in de loop van het jaar zal evolueren.\r\n\r\nHet ART ET MARGES MUSEUM neemt u graag mee voor een duik in zijn reserves, dankzij werken die door de invloed van mode en smaak naar de achtergrond waren verdwenen, serveert u zijn nieuwe ontdekkingen op blaadje en stelt de marge in vraag, met de hulp van kunstenaars uit de hedendaagse scene die resoluut experimenteren met de grenzen van art brut. Oeps! Noem het geen art brut, zei hij!\r\n\r\nFOCUS\r\n06.04.2023\u201402.07.2023 Francis Goidts | Executive Master Food Design ARBA ESA\r\n06.07.2023\u201405.11.2023 Adalberto Colarelli | Shen \u00d6zdemir\r\n09.11.2023\u201428.01.2024Margot | Pratique de l\u2019exposition ESA Saint-Luc Bruxelles\r\n08.02.2024\u201421.04.2024 Norbert Moutier | \u00c9ric Croes\r\n(Let op: het museum is tussen deze periodes gesloten voor montage)\r\n","performers":"Francis Goidts, Executive Master Food Design ARBA ESA, Adalberto Colarelli, Shen \u00d6zdemir, Margot, Pratique de l'exposition ESA Saint-Luc Bruxelles, Norbert Moutier, \u00c9ric Croes ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","email":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 94 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554601"}},"place":{"id":738,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art et marges","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Art brut - Outsider Art - Zeitgen\u00f6ssische Kunst\r\n\r\nDas Museum Art et Marges zeigt eine Sammlung, die seit den 1980er-Jahren kontinuierlich w\u00e4chst. Dabei handelt es sich um Kunst abseits des Mainstreams, die einen Blick auf die autodidaktischen K\u00fcnslter wirft, Kunstateliers f\u00fcr Menschen mit geistiger Behinderung oder in Psychiatrien. \r\nIn den Ausstellungen mischen sich K\u00fcnstler diesseits und jenseits der Grenze des \"Au\u00dfenseitertums\" (engl. Begriff \"Art Outsider\"), die die Kunst und deren Beschr\u00e4nkungen hinterfragt.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Art & marges museum","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Located in the heart of Brussels, the Art et marges museum is dedicated to \u2018art brut\u2019 or \u2018outsider art\u2019.\nIts collection was built up from the mid-1980s with artworks from self-taught artists and artistic workshops for the mentally disabled and the psychologically fragile. It now comprises over 4,500 international works produced outside the established contemporary art circuit.\n\nIts temporary exhibitions bring together artists from both sides of the fringe, questioning the boundaries of art and its very definition.\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art et marges","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Situ\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, le Art et marges mus\u00e9e est consacr\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019Art brut ou outsider.\nSa collection s\u2019est constitu\u00e9e d\u00e8s le milieu des ann\u00e9es 80 aupr\u00e8s d\u2019artistes autodidactes, d\u2019ateliers artistiques pour personnes en situation de handicap mental ou psychologiquement fragilis\u00e9es. Elle se compose aujourd\u2019hui de plus de 4500 \u0153uvres internationales produites en dehors du circuit \u00e9tabli de l\u2019art contemporain.\n\nSes expositions temporaires m\u00ealent artistes de part et d\u2019autre de la marge, questionnant les fronti\u00e8res de l\u2019art et sa d\u00e9finition-m\u00eame.\n","description_print":"Mus\u00e9e d'art outsider","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo Art)&(Marges","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Desde su creaci\u00f3n, el Centro de Investigaci\u00f3n y Difusi\u00f3n del arte outsider Art en Marge (que se convirti\u00f3 posteriormente en el museo Art)&Marges) aboga por los artistas que no forman parte del circuito cultural oficial. Los conocidos actualmente como \u00aboutsiders\u00bb (ver glosario) son creadores autodidactas que trabajan solos o en talleres creativos para personas psicol\u00f3gicamente vulnerables o con alguna discapacidad mental. Algunos son internos de residencias para discapacitados mentales, hospitales psiqui\u00e1tricos, y otros son trabajadores o extrabajadores de una amplia gama de profesiones: fot\u00f3grafos, anticuarios, zapateros, m\u00fasicos...","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Art & marges museum","address_street_name":"Hoogstraat","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Hoogstraat, 314","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Het Art et marges museum ligt in het hart van Brussel en is gewijd aan outsiderkunst (of Art brut).\nDe basis voor de collectie werd in het midden van de jaren 1980 gelegd met kunstwerken van autodidactische kunstenaars en artistieke ateliers voor mensen met een verstandelijke beperking of psychische kwetsbaarheid. Ze omvat inmiddels meer dan 4.500 internationale werken die buiten het gevestigde hedendaagse kunstcircuit zijn ontstaan.\n\nDe tijdelijke tentoonstellingen brengen werk samen van outsiders en kunstenaars uit het hedendaagse kunstcircuit, waarbij de grenzen en het wezen van kunst ter discussie worden gesteld.\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[2],"translations":{"de":["Marollen"],"pt":[null],"en":["Marolles"],"it":["Marolles"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Marolles"],"sp":["Marolles"],"nl":["Marollen"]}},"zones":{"list":[19,21],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum","S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Centre","South"],"it":["Centro","Sud"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Centre","Sud"],"sp":["Centro","Sur"],"nl":["Centrum","Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":149,"location":{"lat":50.83472811,"lon":4.3463823},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-03-06T09:42:45+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:19+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":738,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art et marges","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Art brut - Outsider Art - Zeitgen\u00f6ssische Kunst\r\n\r\nDas Museum Art et Marges zeigt eine Sammlung, die seit den 1980er-Jahren kontinuierlich w\u00e4chst. Dabei handelt es sich um Kunst abseits des Mainstreams, die einen Blick auf die autodidaktischen K\u00fcnslter wirft, Kunstateliers f\u00fcr Menschen mit geistiger Behinderung oder in Psychiatrien. \r\nIn den Ausstellungen mischen sich K\u00fcnstler diesseits und jenseits der Grenze des \"Au\u00dfenseitertums\" (engl. Begriff \"Art Outsider\"), die die Kunst und deren Beschr\u00e4nkungen hinterfragt.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Art & marges museum","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Located in the heart of Brussels, the Art et marges museum is dedicated to \u2018art brut\u2019 or \u2018outsider art\u2019.\nIts collection was built up from the mid-1980s with artworks from self-taught artists and artistic workshops for the mentally disabled and the psychologically fragile. It now comprises over 4,500 international works produced outside the established contemporary art circuit.\n\nIts temporary exhibitions bring together artists from both sides of the fringe, questioning the boundaries of art and its very definition.\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art et marges","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Situ\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, le Art et marges mus\u00e9e est consacr\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019Art brut ou outsider.\nSa collection s\u2019est constitu\u00e9e d\u00e8s le milieu des ann\u00e9es 80 aupr\u00e8s d\u2019artistes autodidactes, d\u2019ateliers artistiques pour personnes en situation de handicap mental ou psychologiquement fragilis\u00e9es. Elle se compose aujourd\u2019hui de plus de 4500 \u0153uvres internationales produites en dehors du circuit \u00e9tabli de l\u2019art contemporain.\n\nSes expositions temporaires m\u00ealent artistes de part et d\u2019autre de la marge, questionnant les fronti\u00e8res de l\u2019art et sa d\u00e9finition-m\u00eame.\n","description_print":"Mus\u00e9e d'art outsider","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo Art)&(Marges","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Desde su creaci\u00f3n, el Centro de Investigaci\u00f3n y Difusi\u00f3n del arte outsider Art en Marge (que se convirti\u00f3 posteriormente en el museo Art)&Marges) aboga por los artistas que no forman parte del circuito cultural oficial. Los conocidos actualmente como \u00aboutsiders\u00bb (ver glosario) son creadores autodidactas que trabajan solos o en talleres creativos para personas psicol\u00f3gicamente vulnerables o con alguna discapacidad mental. Algunos son internos de residencias para discapacitados mentales, hospitales psiqui\u00e1tricos, y otros son trabajadores o extrabajadores de una amplia gama de profesiones: fot\u00f3grafos, anticuarios, zapateros, m\u00fasicos...","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Art & marges museum","address_street_name":"Hoogstraat","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","a